    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d337">

                <pb facs="0405" n="389" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg389"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.24/10–647: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Flack</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">La Paz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-06T14:00:00-04:00">October 6, 1947—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>863. Renegotiation Lend-Lease has been rather delicate, but Sub-secretary told me
                    today enabling decree was signed by President and Cabinet October 3. He will
                    make early appointment for meeting with Finance Minister, Guachalla,<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d337-f1"/> to determine essential details of initial payment
                    into bank here.</p>
                <p>Subsecretary assured me on Saturday and today (Deptel 532, October 3) Bolivian Government will meet our wishes
                    avoidance publicity specific figures re amount received by Bolivia and amount
                    due, limiting itself in official announcement to statement like “a payment was
                    made to United States on Lend-Lease obligations”. He said Cabinet and some
                    senators had necessarily been informed, but they would regard matter as
                    officially confidential.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Flack</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d337-f1" n="2" xml:id="d337-f1-content">
                <p>Carlos Guachalla.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
